s"},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"p","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Java"},{"type":"p","text":"Git"},{"type":"p","text":"REST APIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Software Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Performance Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"AWS"},{"type":"p","text":"Docker"},{"type":"p","text":"Kubernetes"},{"type":"p","text":"Terraform"},{"type":"p","text":"Cloud Optimization"},{"type":"h","text":"Energy"},{"type":"p","text":"Energy Measurement"},{"type":"p","text":"Power Profiling"},{"type":"p","text":"Energy Efficiency"},{"type":"p","text":"Carbon-Aware Computing"},{"type":"p","text":"Green Software"},{"type":"p","text":"Resource Optimization"},{"type":"h","text":"IoT / Edge"},{"type":"p","text":"ESP32"},{"type":"p","text":"Raspberry Pi"},{"type":"p","text":"MQTT"},{"type":"p","text":"Sensors"},{"type":"p","text":"Embedded Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Edge Computing"},{"type":"h","text":"Data / AI"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Time-Series Data"},{"type":"p","text":"pandas"},{"type":"p","text":"Machine Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Anomaly Detection"},{"type":"p","text":"Optimization"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be capable of developing and measuring an energy-aware system:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Application / IoT Device","System Monitoring","CPU / Memory / Network Metrics","Power / Energy Measurement","Energy Analytics","Optimization Algorithm","Resource Scheduling","Reduced Energy Consumption","Performance Validation"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should be able to answer three questions for every optimization:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How much performance changed?"},{"text":"How much energy changed?"},{"text":"Why did the change occur?"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For B.Tech/B.E. — Green Computing 